ve-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nsince matrix addition is associative.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"</p>\n</div></div>",
